31,1,1,talk,Mizuki,,"Now that the first night has passed, we should see if anyone has information to share. If the Seer found something, now is the time to speak. Does anyone have a lead?","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,1,1,talk,Sakura,,"I wonder if the Seer found anything! I'm dying to know! Did you find a werewolf? Or maybe someone super suspicious? Come on, tell us, tell us! Hehe!","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Toshio,,"I have information. I divined Kenji last night, and the result was clear: Kenji is the werewolf. I suggest we move to execute him immediately to ensure the village's safety.","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"That is a very direct and serious claim, Toshio. If your divination is accurate, the solution is simple. However, we must be certain, as a mistake now would be quite costly for us.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Kenji,,"What?! No way! Toshio, you're lying! I'm not the werewolf! I've been honest this whole time! Why would you say that? You're trying to trick everyone into voting for me!","{""words"":30,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,2,talk,Mizuki,,"Toshio, that is a very bold and definitive claim. If you are indeed the Seer, the game ends today. However, if you are the werewolf lying to frame Kenji, this is a calculated move. Kenji, how do you respond?","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Sakura,,"Whoa, this is getting intense! Toshio, you're so cool for coming out so fast! But Kenji looks so sad... are you really the wolf, Kenji? Or is Toshio playing a big prank on us? Hehe, I can't tell!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Toshio,,"My claim is not a prank, Sakura. I am the Seer, and the result was definitive. Kenji's emotional denial is a predictable reaction for a werewolf caught early. I have no reason to lie and risk my own position.","{""words"":39,""mentions"":[""Sakura"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a difficult position for Kenji, but Toshio's confidence is striking. If we trust the Seer's word, the path is clear. However, we must consider if this is a strategy to eliminate a fellow human.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Kenji,,"I'm not lying! I'm just a regular kid! Toshio is the one acting weird and trying to get me in trouble. Please, don't believe him! I'm not the werewolf, I promise!","{""words"":31,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,3,talk,Mizuki,,"If Toshio is the Seer, the game is over. If he's the werewolf, he's trying to win instantly. Since we only have one werewolf, the risk of executing a villager is high, but the reward of winning is higher. I'm leaning toward Toshio.","{""words"":43,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Sakura,,"Wait, Mizuki! You're leaning toward Toshio? But Kenji is crying! It's so sad! Maybe Toshio is just being a meanie and making things up to look like a hero? I can't decide! This is like a real mystery!","{""words"":38,""mentions"":[""Mizuki"",""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Toshio,,"Emotional appeals are irrelevant to the facts. Kenji's distress is a performance to garner sympathy. If I were the werewolf, I would not expose myself so early. The most logical choice is to trust the divination.","{""words"":36,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,"The logic is indeed compelling. If Toshio is the Seer, the game ends now. If he is the wolf, he has placed a target on his own back for tomorrow. I am inclined to trust the divination.","{""words"":37,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Kenji,,"Please, listen to me! I'm not performing! Toshio is just trying to sound smart to trick you all. If you vote for me, the real werewolf will still be here! I'm just a villager!","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,4,talk,Mizuki,,"The logic holds. If Toshio is lying, he's essentially committing suicide for the next round. The risk for him is too high unless he's desperate. I'll trust the Seer's result. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":34,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Sakura,,"Hmm, everyone is voting for Kenji... it's so scary! I don't want to be the one to make a mistake, but Toshio seems so sure! Sorry, Kenji! I'll vote for Kenji too!","{""words"":32,""mentions"":[""Kenji"",""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Toshio,,"The evidence is absolute. Kenji's desperation only confirms the result of my divination. For the safety of the village, we must act now. I vote for Kenji.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"It is a heavy decision, but the logic presented by Toshio and Mizuki is sound. To doubt the Seer now would be to risk the village's survival. I will also vote for Kenji.","{""words"":33,""mentions"":[""Toshio"",""Mizuki"",""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Kenji,,"This is all wrong! I'm not the werewolf! You're all being tricked by Toshio! Please, just think about this one more time! I don't want to go! I'm just a villager! I vote for Toshio!","{""words"":35,""mentions"":[""Toshio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
